{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35615","headline":"送职方王郎中吏部刘员外自太原郑相公幕继奉徵书归省署 · 李山甫","name":"送职方王郎中吏部刘员外自太原郑相公幕继奉徵书归省署","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双凤衔书次第飞，玉皇催促列仙归。\n云开日月临青琐，风卷烟霞上紫微。\n莲影一时空俭府，兰香同处扑尧衣。\n此生长扫朱门者，每向人间梦粉闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}